* C1: inductively-degenerated cascode CS LNA (Shaeffer & Lee, JSSC 1997 family)
* Structure-only transcription; all component values come from the sizer.
* Cascode gate tied to VDD (AC ground); input/bias DC handled by the harness
* bias inserter. Round-1 external, approved 2026-09-11.
L L1 VIN1 n1
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 n3 VSS
L L2 n3 VSS
NMOS NM2 n4 VDD n2 VSS
L L3 VDD n4
C C1 n4 VOUT1
